{
    "title": "Baby Panda's Kids Play",
    "description": "Baby Panda's Kids Play includes all the BabyBus games and cartoons that kids love. It covers various themes such as life, habits, safety, art, logic and other topics to help kids learn everyday knowledge and exercise their thinking skills through fun Baby Panda games. Check it out!\r\n\r\nLIFE SIMULATION\r\nHere kids can go shopping at a supermarket, take a beach vacation, go to an amusement park, and even explore the underwater world. Kids can explore the big world and enjoy different lifestyles through different life simulations!\r\n\r\nSAFETY HABITS\r\nBaby Panda's Kids Play provides a lot of safety and habit tips for kids. Baby Panda games give kids a chance to practice brushing their teeth, going to the toilet, escaping and saving themselves in a simulated fire. Through such practice, kids gradually develop good living habits and learn to protect themselves.\r\n\r\nART CREATION\r\nThere are fun activities like designing makeup for cute cats, making birthday cards for mom, and creating a diamond crown for princess that allow kids to give full play to their design talents and feel the fun of art creation!\r\n\r\nLOGIC TRAINING\r\nLogic training is essential in a child's development! Baby Panda's Kids Play is designed with a variety of logic levels, including graphic matching, cube building, addition, subtraction, number counting, and more to help improve kids' logical thinking skills!\r\n\r\nIn addition to the Baby Panda Games, a lot of animated videos have been added to Baby Panda's Kids Play: The MeowMi Family, Monster Truck, Sheriff Labrador and other popular cartoons. Open the videos and watch them now!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- Lots of content for kids: 9 themes and 70+ Baby Panda games for kids to play;\r\n- 700+ episodes of cartoons: The MeowMi Family, Monster Truck, Food Story and other cartoons;\r\n- Faster access: no need to download sub-packages to play the games;\r\n- Takes up little memory space on your mobile phone: download size is less than 30M;\r\n-Supports offline mode: play the games anytime and anywhere;\r\n- Completely free: no in-app purchase, no need to subscribe;\r\n- Usage time control: parents can set time limits on use to protect your kids' eyesight;\r\n- Regular update: new games and content will be added every month;\r\n- Lots of new cartoons and mini-games will be available in the future, so please stay tuned!\r\n\r\nAbout BabyBus\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nAt BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids' creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids' perspective to help them explore the world on their own.\r\n\r\nNow BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children's apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nContact us: ser@babybus.com\r\nVisit us: http://www.babybus.com",
